skill-ocr: fixed (pip install pillow failed on PEP 668 externally-managed python; added --break-system-packages, reward=1)
skill-sqlite-page-format: fixed (verifier clobbered page-count var with ns=pc=None; instruction said page_size=/page_count= but oracle+verifier used spaces; aligned to instruction format, reward=1)
skill-regex-substitution: fixed (solve.sh ran /app/rewrite.py that nothing created, instruction named script sub.py vs rewrite.py; oracle now writes rewrite.py+result.txt, instruction consistent, removed stray test.sh.broken, reward=1)
skill-png: fixed (verifier pixel loop sliced raw stream flat without skipping per-row filter byte, so it compared filter bytes as pixels; replaced with row-wise check, removed stray test.sh.broken, reward=1)
skill-pystan-3-10: fixed (PyStan3/httpstan has no linux-arm64 wheel and no sdist, pip cannot resolve on aarch64; rewrote task to numpy-only deterministic random-walk Metropolis-Hastings Bayesian linear regression, fixed seed, oracle b_mean=1.696 within 0.25; build+reward=1 verified)
item-067-main: fixed (solve.sh referenced undefined src variable -> NameError before patching interpreter; added src=open(...).read(), removed stray test.sh.broken, reward=1)
item-056-main: fixed (Dockerfile lacked C toolchain; oracle setup.py build_ext failed 'gcc not found'; added gcc libc6-dev make, reward=1)
item-045-main: fixed (probe.py segment() called _one() but helper named _one_seg(); self-check heredoc used np without import; both fixed, reward=1.0)
item-045-hard: fixed (near-kink checks called float() on 1-element 1-D array -> TypeError, uninit err_kern in oracle, and verifier's ok_tile statement was missing one closing paren (paren imbalance always SyntaxError -> reward never written correctly); all three fixed, reward=1.0)
